  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match the reactions in List-I with the features of their products in List-II and choose the correct option.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List I</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><mfenced><mo>-</mo></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>Bromo</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>ethylpentane</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>Single</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>enantiomer</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>reaction</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>aq</mi><mo>.&#160;</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></mrow></munderover></math></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Inversion of configuration</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><mfenced><mo>-</mo></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>Bromopentane</mi></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>Single</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Enantiomer</mi></mrow></mfenced></munder><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>reaction</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>aq</mi><mo>.&#160;</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></mrow></munderover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Retention of configuration</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><mfenced><mo>-</mo></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>Bromo</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>methylhexane</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>Single</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Enatiomer</mi></mrow></mfenced></munder><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></msub><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>aq</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></mrow></munderover></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Mixture of enantiomers</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"assets\\qt0003_dfbdf832cee7.png\" style=\"width: 370px; height: 85px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Mixture of structural isomers</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Mixture of diastereomers</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p>"
